 ["A shape has reflection symmetry when a mirror line makes both sides match. An isosceles triangle has 1 line, a square has 4 and a circle has infinitely many.","A shape has rotational symmetry when it looks the same after turning less than a full turn. A square matches after 90, 180 and 270 degrees.","Letters like H and O have both kinds of symmetry."],
